From: OpenWrt Tenda AC8 port
Subject: [PATCH] wifi-scripts: use the root netdev of Realtek rtl8192cd phys

The vendor rtl8192cd driver creates the wlanN root interface of every
wiphy itself (virtual device RTKWiFiN) and does not support creating it
from userspace, so point the default wifi-iface at it.

---
--- a/package/network/config/wifi-scripts/files/lib/wifi/mac80211.uc
+++ b/package/network/config/wifi-scripts/files/lib/wifi/mac80211.uc
@@ -115,6 +115,10 @@
 set ${si}.disabled='${defaults ? 0 : 1}'
 
 `);
+		/* Realtek rtl8192cd: the driver owns the root netdev of each phy */
+		let rtk = match(phy.path, /^virtual\/RTKWiFi([0-9]+)\/RTKWiFi[0-9]+$/);
+		if (rtk)
+			print(`set ${si}.ifname='wlan${rtk[1]}'\nset ${si}.macaddr='${macaddr}'\n`);
 		config[name] = {};
 		commit = true;
 	}
